From b4f9cd818916a872f39bc8c0f59e876ba549b72b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: video-pipeline-audit <fix@flexamarket.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 19:03:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] build: rebuild marketplace dist with video pipeline fix
 applied

The repo intentionally tracks artifacts/marketplace/dist/ (see .gitignore
comment 'Allow marketplace pre-built frontend in git so production always
has latest code'), so the dist/ chunks must be kept in lockstep with the
source files.  Running 'pnpm --filter @workspace/marketplace run build'
regenerates these chunks with the now-fixed videoUrl.ts and BoostWizard.tsx
included.

Verified the rebuilt bundles:
- VideoPost / MyBoosts / VideoFeed chunks: zero fl_faststart references.
- index chunk: only the regex stripper retains the string (no injection).
- BoostWizard chunk: only the regex stripper retains the string.
- index.html points at the new hash-named chunks.

No source file is changed by this commit; it is purely the build output.
